re of an infestation of sorts. Kill the Erillion soldiers who have invaded alir homeland.\n\n---\n\nKill 15 soldiers 0/15 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nSpeak with Mabus 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mabus'\nYou have helped Mabus rid the valley of unwanted \"pests\".\n_Rewards:_\n160 platinum\nExperience\n- Eltarki's Diary - Life and Death [item=98146]",
