      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Valley of Lunanyn [zone=807]\n**Who:**\n- Kallik the Cook [npc=38150]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a dirty oashim [npc=38261]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 15 17:40:46 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo kill task begins with Kallik the Cook in the Valley of Lunanyn, located at 1730, -1130, -46(in the Rallosian camp in the northeastern part of the larger section of the zone)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Kallik the Cook'\nKallik the Cook says 'What is it now?!' He brandishes a cleaver, as he turns towards you, but suddenly halts in surprise, 'Oh! I'm sorry, I thought you were my assistant with more [bad news].'\nYou say, 'Bad news?'\nKallik the Cook says 'We've been having some real trouble with our food provisions. Those [eerie cats] have been raiding my meat supplies every night. And if that wasn't bad enough, the whole camp is swarming with [vermin] - some of which look as though they may be diseased! I ask you, how's a Halfling to cook in these conditions?!'\nYou say, 'What vermin?'\nKallik the Cook says 'Don't tell the troops', he glances around conspiratorially, 'but I've been feeding them oashim-meat for a while now. After the cats ate all our meat, I had to resort to those oashim, but I only catch the fresh, healthy-looking ones. Could you get rid of the others for me?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Rat-a-chewy'.\nKallik can't use infected or diseased rat in his stews. Go kill some of the dirty oashim that threaten to infect his 'fresh meat' supply.\n\n---\n\nKill 12 dirty oashim 0/12 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nReport back to Kallik with your success 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nYou say, 'Hail, Kallik the Cook'\nKallik the Cook says, 'Great! Now I won't have to worry about those filthy vermin infecting my fresh meat supply. Oh! There's a plump one.' He picks up his cleaver, eyeing a young oashim nearby, 'Here, mousey, mousey'. The oashim, sensing danger, skitters away, foiling Kallik's apparent dinner plans, 'Rats! Looks like it'll be porridge again tonight.\n_Rewards:_\n106 platinum\nExperience\n- Eltarki's Diary - Life and Death [item=98146]",
