      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Valley of Lunanyn [zone=807]\n**Who:**\n- Hallay [npc=38149]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a wraith of Arelis [npc=38363]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 15 17:41:46 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo kill task begins with Hallay in the Valley of Lunanyn, located at 1725, -1150, -45 (in the Rallosian camp in the northeastern part of the larger section of the zone)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Hallay'\nHallay says 'Grrr!' She snarls like an animal, 'What do yeh want, ye pesky Halfling? Can`na yeh see I'm [busy] thinkin'?'\nYou say, 'Busy with what?'\nHallay says 'I know we're low on supplies, but I can'na go out to collect more provisions with those wretched wraiths ou' there.' She seems to be more irritated by them than afraid, 'I'd like ta slaughter the lot o' 'em, but meh cleaver just goes clean through 'em! There must be some way fer me to [defeat] those blasted things.'\nYou say, 'I can defeat for you'\nHallay says 'Yeh think yeh can defeat them, do ye?' She seems to have taken your offer of assistance as a challenge, instead, 'If yer are so eager fer death then, be my guest!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Who You Gonna Call?'.\nHallay has challenged you to vanquish the wraiths which haunt the valley.\n\n---\n\nKill 12 wraiths of Arelis 0/12 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nReturn to Hallay and tell ali of your triumph 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nYou say, 'Hail, Hallay'\nHallay seems momentarily stunned, and then begins to beam approvingly, 'Survived, have yeh? I had mistaken yeh fer a weakling, but it seems ye do have some fire in yer blood, after all. Well done!'\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n106 platinum\n- Eltarki's Diary - Life and Death [item=98146]",
