      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Valley of Lunanyn [zone=807]\n**Who:**\n- Captain Gre Metkal [npc=38148]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Prophet Order IX [item=100224]\n- Prophet Order VI [item=99811]\n- Prophet Order XII [item=100242]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Scout IX [npc=38274]\n- Scout IX Leader [npc=38269]\n- Scout VI [npc=38273]\n- Scout VI Leader [npc=38270]\n- Scout XII [npc=38272]\n- Scout XII Leader [npc=38271]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Lunanyn #1: Raid and Recover [quest=5395]\n- Lunanyn #2: The Assassination Game [quest=5418]\n- Lunanyn #4: The Enemy of My Enemy [quest=5420]\n- Lunanyn #5: The Memory Remains [quest=5421]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 16 02:38:08 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the third in a series of five; a solo task that begins with Captain Gre Metkal in the Valley of Lunanyn (Rallosian camp in northeastern part of the lower section of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"Raid and Recover\"\n\\- Completion of \"The Assassination Game\"\n\\- (no minimum required skill level in Alaran Language)\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Gre Metkal'\nCaptain Gre Metkal says 'You must be the one who helped Geirdan. I can use someone who can take care of business. If you are [willing] to get your hands dirty, that is.'\nYou say, 'I'm willing...'\nCaptain Gre Metkal says 'Good to hear! I seem to be missing some scouts. I dispatched a small scouting party to keep an eye on the Erillian camp. But it has been many days since we have heard from them. They were ordered to set up in a location where they could easily see the camp, but not too close to be discovered. [Find] their camp and find out why we have not heard from them.'\nYou say, 'I'll find them...'\nCaptain Gre Metkal says 'Excellent! Be careful out there. This land holds many dangers.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Uncharted Territory'.\nCaptain Gre Metkal is struggling to continue to fight. Once his army controls the valley, they will be able to move troops more freely into the other areas of Alaris. He has asked you to find the scouts with whom he has lost contact. Only when their whereabouts are known, will he be able to concentrate on doing something about the patrolling Erillion army nearby.\n\n---\n\nFind the Rallosian scout camp 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\n_The camp is found in the southern end of the zone near location -800, 1000._\nSpeak with Captain Gre Metkal 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\n_Task Window Says:_ It appears that the camp has been deserted with signs of a struggle and no survivors. Captain Metkal will be disappointed to hear that his scouts have been killed.\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Gre Metkal'\nCaptain Gre Metkal says 'The Erillion commanders must have sent scouts of their own to slaughter my troops! You must find those who are responsible and exact deadly revenge. Not only will it hamper their own scouting, it will be payback for what they have done!'\nLoot 1 Prophet Order VI 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nLoot 1 Prophet Order XII 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nLoot 1 Prophet Order IX 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\n_Task Window Says:_ The Erillion scouts who have killed Metkal's troops must be dealt with! Collect orders as proof of their demise.\n_The scouts spawn in the central area of the zone. They're not KOS. They come in groups of three (one leader; two scouts). They can be split. Each drops one Prophet Order (so, if you have a full group of six, you'll need to kill each set twice)._\n_NOTE: These items are NOT pre-lootable._\nDeliver 1 Prophet Order VI to Captain Gre Metkal 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nDeliver 1 Prophet Order XII to Captain Gre Metkal 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nDeliver 1 Prophet Order IX to Captain Gre Metkal 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nSpeak to Captain Gre Metkal 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Gre Metkal'\nCaptain Gre Metkal says 'More trophies for Zek! Thank you for your efforts.'\nYou have found the location of the scout's camp, and have dispatched those believed to be responsible.\n_Rewards:_\nEltarki's Diary - Life and Death\n160 platinum\nExperience\n- Eltarki's Diary - Life and Death [item=98146]",
    },
