      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Valley of Lunanyn [zone=807]\n**Who:**\n- Aedros [npc=38155]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Taleg [npc=38268]\n- The Daevan [npc=38289]\n- a foul reega [npc=38291]\n- a nefarious reega [npc=38292]\n- a vile reega [npc=38290]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Into the Abyss [quest=5423]\n- Lunanyn #1: Raid and Recover [quest=5395]\n- Lunanyn #2: The Assassination Game [quest=5418]\n- Lunanyn #3: Uncharted Territory [quest=5419]\n- Lunanyn #4: The Enemy of My Enemy [quest=5420]\n- The Herald of Oratory [quest=5424]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 16 02:39:27 2011\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the fifth in the series of five; a solo task that begins with Aedros in the Valley of Lunanyn (-160, -530 -- central part of the zone's lower half)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- Completion of \"Raid and Recover\"\n\\- Completion of \"The Assassination Game\"\n\\- Completion of \"Uncharted Territory\"\n\\- Completion of \"The Enemy of My Enemy\"\n\\- (no minimum required skill level in Alaran Language)\nYou say, 'Hail, Aedros'\nAedros says, in Alaran, 'It appears our new agreement may have hit a snag. Taleg, another wraith here in the village is not happy with my agreement to assist you and the armies of Zek. Taleg believes the armies of Zek are responsible for destroying our village. I happen to know it was The [Daevan]. Perhaps you could [convince] Taleg otherwise?'\nYou say, 'I'll convince him'\nAedros says, in Alaran, 'Taleg should be nearby.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Memory Remains'.\nTaleg is not happy that Aedros has agreed to side with the forces from Norrath. In fact, Taleg blames the Norrathians for destroying alir village. Aedros has asked you to speak with Taleg and see if you can convince ali of the truth that it was The Daevan that destroyed the village and not the Norrathians.\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Taleg 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\n_Taleg is found a little ways northwest of Aedros._\nYou say, 'Hail, Taleg'\nTaleg says, in Alaran, 'I do not believe Aedros' claim that our village was destroyed by some [mythical creature]. Aedros is a fool to trust you and all the armies of Zek.'\nKill the Reega in The Abyss 0/8 (Valley of Lunanyn)\n_Task Window Says:_ Enter the tunnels known as The Abyss and destroy the Reega that stand in your way.\n_You'll find reega in throughout the eastern tunnel system. These are among the higher level trash mobs in the zone, reaching up to Level 95 and hitting for ~10,000._\nSpeak with The Daevan 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\n_In one of the central dead ends in the tunnel system, you'll find a Nekhon called The Daevan. Four mobs spawn in its room and should be cleared out before you hail it._\nYou say, 'Hail, The Daevan'\nThe Daevan says, in Alaran, 'I normally have to send my reega to collect victims. How nice of my food to come to me for a change!'\nThe Daevan says, in Alaran, 'I will enjoy the music of your screams as you die in agony!'\n_The Daevan attacks. It hits for a max ~11,500._\nFight The Daevan 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nThe Daevan says, in Alaran, 'You have no hope of defeating me in this place of existence. Go. Go and tell others of the coming wrath I will spread across this pitiful, battle-torn land.'\nSpeak with Taleg 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nYou say, 'Hail, Taleg'\nTaleg says, in Alaran, 'Just as I thought. You return with no proof. I grow tired of you. Now you die!'\nDefeat Taleg 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\n_Taleg hits for a max ~11,000. Note that the wraiths around him will assist him._\nSpeak with Aedros 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nYou say, 'Hail, Aedros'\nAedros says, in Alaran, 'It is unfortunate that Taleg had to be killed. It does effectively end the uprising against me however. I also hear that you confronted The Daeven. I am afraid your encounter with him may not be your last.'\n_Rewards:_\nEltarki's Diary - Life and Death\n160 platinum\nExperience\n- Eltarki's Diary - Life and Death [item=98146]",
