      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Valley of Lunanyn [zone=807]\n**Who:**\n- Grave Digger Undros [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Oashim Poison [item=98638]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a baby oashim [npc=39123]\n- a mutated oashim [npc=39122]\n- an oashim breeder [npc=38265]\n- an oashim nest [npc=38266]\n**Era:** | !House of Thule\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 16 02:40:33 2011\nModified: Thu Apr 30 07:34:56 2026 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Grave Digger Undros in the Valley of Lunanyn at about 1400, -415, -45 (south of the small canyon that leads out from the upper section of the zone)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- (no minimum required skill level in Alaran Language)\n\n---\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Grave Digger Undros'\nGrave Digger Undros says, in Alaran, 'Those filthy oashim! Here I am trying to give decent burials for those that have fallen in combat, and the oashim tear the bodies to shreds before I can do anything! They are making quite a mess. Do you think you could [help] me out?'\nYou say, 'Of course I'll help!'\nGrave Digger Undros says, in Alaran, 'See if you can find any of the oashim nests and destroy them! I know this won't solve the problem completely, but hopefully it will cut their numbers down a bit.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Filthy Oashim!'.\nGrave Digger Undros is just trying to give a proper burial to those who have fallen in battle. The oashim however are making it difficult as they enjoy feeding on corpses, and ripping them to shreds causing a huge mess.\nFind some oashim nests and destroy them. Kill the baby oashim that emerge from the destroyed nests.\n\n---\n\nDestroy the oashim nests and kill the baby oashim that were hiding within 0/12 (Valley of Lunanyn)\n_Nests are found in the caves along the western boundary of the zone, inside a cave at /way -1091, 1284 (you can find Pika standing on the roof of the cave). Upon destroying a nest, several baby oashims pop out. These are simple kills._\nSpeak with Grave Digger Undros 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nYou say, 'Hail, Grave Digger Undros'\nGrave Digger Undros says, in Alaran, 'Good job taking those nests out. Some of the local farmers gave me this vial. They say it will kill the oashim. I haven't been able to test it though. Why don't you try it out on one of the oashim breeders? They are far too bloated with babies to attack, so this should be pretty easy. If you lose your poison, let me know and I can [give] you some more.'\nYou say, 'Give me some more!'\nGrave Digger Undros says, in Alaran, 'Try not to lose it again.'\nGive the oashim poison to an oashim breeder 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\n_Breeders are found in the backs of the caves on the western boundary of the zone and one by the Rallosian camp. Upon hand-in, the oashim attacks, hitting for a max ~11,000._\nan oashim breeder does not react to the poison as you thought it would!\na mutated oashim is completely silent as it attacks.\nDefeat the mutant oashim 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\n_Task Window Says:_ The poison didn't work. It did however mutate the oashim and it looks angry! Defeat it!\na mutated oashim has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na mutated oashim's corpse squeals in panic as the life leaves its body.\nSpeak with Grave Digger Undros 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nYou say, 'Hail, Grave Digger Undros'\nGrave Digger Undros says, in Alaran, 'So the poison didn't quite have the effect we were hoping for, huh? Sorry about that. Thanks for helping me out though. Take this for your efforts. The previous owner won't be needing it anymore.'\n_Rewards:_\n213 platinum\nExperience\nEltarki's Diary - Life and Death\n- Eltarki's Diary - Life and Death [item=98146]",
